scenario: c.libnghttp2 runs HTTP/2 client/server frame exchange with callbacks and HPACK deflate/inflate without unsafe
requires: network
platforms: darwin, linux, windows

new directory
run: with init .
run: with get c.libnghttp2
write src/main.with from libnghttp2_main.with
run: with run
expect exit: 0
expect stdout contains: libnghttp2 ok
